      "text": "[7:56PM] #LekkiPeninsula #TrafficUpdate \n\nLekki Peninsula Scheme 1 is largely smooth, with good movement reported on most routes. \nLekki Roundabout to Lekki Peninsula Gate, Road 12, Admiralty Roundabout, and Dome/Freedom Way are all traffic-free. \nHowever, there's some congestion from VFS to Ikate Gate due to traffic light alternation. The return journey is smooth, with personnel strategically positioned at key points to manage traffic. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
