      "text": "[8:06PM] #PWD #TrafficUpdate \n\nPWD Bolade intersection to Ile-Zik, National Theatre, and Ikeja along the flyover are clear. Ile-Zik to Sule Junction and Ile-Zik to Mangoro, Cement, and Iyana Dopemu underneath the bridge are also flowing well.\n\nThe return journey is calm, with no impediments reported, and officers are on ground managing traffic effectively.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
